# Cloudflare Pages checks for a matching static file first (so /e/app.js,
# /e/style.css etc. are served as-is) and only falls back to these rewrites
# when no file matches — which is exactly the /e/:slug, /h/:slug, /s/:slug
# dynamic-page behavior the app needs. 200 = rewrite (URL stays as typed),
# not a redirect.
/e/*      /e/index.html      200
/h/*      /h/index.html      200
/s/*      /s/index.html      200
/admin/*  /admin/index.html  200
